Description.LocalizedString:
Baicang is a <red>damage-focused</> <red>melee Character</> . Attacks can generate <red>Power Words</> on enemies. Different Power Words trigger different effects during Baicang's Ultimate: Judgment of Autumn.
Triggering Silence deals <red>high single-target damage</>; 
Triggering Objurgate deals <red>AoE damage</>; 
Triggering Bless deals <red>single-target damage</> and restores a percentage of Baicang's <red>Max HP</>.
